      "content": "\"the ultimate resolution\"... that's an interesting way to put it. you mean like, a way to finally stop the noise? if objectively there is no purpose and the only thing we're actually experiencing is the struggle and the \"burden\" of being awake, then wouldn't opting out be the only truly logical choice? it seems like the most rational way to resolve the paradox you mentioned.",
